  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First stable release. The public API is promised from here under semantic versioning: a breaking change waits for a new major version, and each release is checked against the last one published. Breaking since 0.3.0-alpha: AgiSoundEmulation moved to Daventry.Agi, SciSoundDevice to Daventry.Sci, Mt32Model and Mt32RomSet to Daventry.Audio; SaveCompression, FileSaveStore.MergeSubfolders, Surface8.Blit and Surface8.CopyFromShifted are internal; Engine.LoadingNotSupported is gone; BrowserGameLibrary.Confirm and Download moved to the new BrowserPage; BrowserHostOptions takes init like SdlHostOptions. Fixed: HeadlessHost gives only an engine's very first tick zero elapsed time. Runs AGI v2 and v3, the preAGI games, SCI0 to SCI3 and the Apple II Hi-Res Adventures, and gives the same output, to the byte, on Windows, Linux and macOS. What it does not do yet is in the README under Not yet.",
